WEBVTT

00:00:14.977 --> 00:00:17.980
[♪♪♪]

00:00:42.265 --> 00:00:43.875
Ah! Ah!

00:00:59.804 --> 00:01:00.805
[BELL RINGS]

00:01:15.516 --> 00:01:18.084
Not lost, are you, my dear?

00:01:18.084 --> 00:01:20.434
I'm fine, thank you.

00:01:20.434 --> 00:01:22.349
I was just go--

00:01:22.349 --> 00:01:24.177
Come with us.

00:01:24.177 --> 00:01:27.006
We'll help you
find your way back.

00:01:27.006 --> 00:01:28.181
No, please.

00:01:28.181 --> 00:01:29.399
Harry?

00:01:29.399 --> 00:01:30.966
Hagrid!

00:01:30.966 --> 00:01:32.663
What do you think
you're doing down here?

00:01:32.663 --> 00:01:34.100
Come on.

00:01:39.931 --> 00:01:41.498
You're a mess, Harry.

00:01:41.498 --> 00:01:43.239
Skulking around Knockturn Alley?

00:01:43.239 --> 00:01:45.198
Dodgy place.

00:01:45.198 --> 00:01:46.895
Don't want no one
to see you there.

00:01:46.895 --> 00:01:48.853
People will think
you're up to no good.

00:01:48.853 --> 00:01:51.595
I was lost, I--

00:01:51.595 --> 00:01:52.901
Hang on.

00:01:52.901 --> 00:01:54.859
What were you doing
down there, then?

00:01:54.859 --> 00:01:56.948
Me? Oh, I was....

00:01:56.948 --> 00:01:59.908
I was looking
for Flesh-Eating Slug Repellent.

00:01:59.908 --> 00:02:03.172
They're ruining
all the school cabbages.

00:02:08.743 --> 00:02:10.875
Harry! Hagrid!

00:02:10.875 --> 00:02:12.486
Hello, Hermione.

00:02:12.486 --> 00:02:14.053
It's so good
to see you.

00:02:14.053 --> 00:02:15.576
Oh, it's great
to see you too.

00:02:15.576 --> 00:02:17.665
What did you do to your glasses?

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:21.103
Oculus Reparo.

00:02:25.325 --> 00:02:27.283
I definitely need
to remember that one.

00:02:27.283 --> 00:02:29.720
You'll be all right,
now then, Harry?

00:02:29.720 --> 00:02:31.940
Right.
I'll leave you to it, then.

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:33.594
Thank you. Bye.
Bye.

00:02:33.594 --> 00:02:35.596
Come on, everyone's
been so worried.

00:02:45.997 --> 00:02:47.521
Oh, Harry.

00:02:47.521 --> 00:02:49.088
Thank goodness.

00:02:49.088 --> 00:02:51.220
We'd hoped you'd only
gone one grate too far.

00:02:51.220 --> 00:02:53.440
MAN:
Ladies and gentlemen,
Mr. Gilderoy Lockhart.

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:54.876
Oh, here he is.

00:02:59.533 --> 00:03:02.362
Mum fancies him.

00:03:02.362 --> 00:03:04.190
Make way there, please!

00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:05.408
Let me by, madam.
Thank you.

00:03:05.408 --> 00:03:07.149
Excuse me, little girl.

00:03:07.149 --> 00:03:08.977
This is for the Daily Prophet.

00:03:13.721 --> 00:03:15.026
It can't be.

00:03:15.026 --> 00:03:16.115
Harry Potter?

00:03:17.942 --> 00:03:19.205
Harry Potter.

00:03:19.205 --> 00:03:20.815
Excuse me, madam.

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:24.340
Nice big smile, Harry.

00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:26.125
Together, you and I
rate the front page.

00:03:26.125 --> 00:03:27.561
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:03:27.561 --> 00:03:30.085
what an extraordinary moment
this is.

00:03:30.085 --> 00:03:32.783
When young Harry

00:03:32.783 --> 00:03:35.003
stepped into Flourish and Blotts
this morning

00:03:35.003 --> 00:03:37.919
to purchase my autobiography,
Magical Me...

00:03:40.835 --> 00:03:42.924
Which, incidentally,

00:03:42.924 --> 00:03:46.841
is currently celebrating
its 27th week

00:03:46.841 --> 00:03:49.322
atop the Daily Prophet
bestseller list,

00:03:49.322 --> 00:03:50.714
he had no idea

00:03:50.714 --> 00:03:53.978
that he would in fact
be leaving...

00:03:53.978 --> 00:03:56.503
with my...

00:03:56.503 --> 00:04:00.376
entire collected works...

00:04:00.376 --> 00:04:01.638
free of charge.

00:04:04.685 --> 00:04:07.253
Now. Ladies?

00:04:07.253 --> 00:04:10.908
Harry, you give me those
and I'll get them signed.

00:04:10.908 --> 00:04:12.171
All of you, wait outside.

00:04:12.171 --> 00:04:14.782
That's it, Ron.

00:04:23.617 --> 00:04:25.706
Bet you loved that,
didn't you, Potter?

00:04:25.706 --> 00:04:28.883
Famous Harry Potter,
can't even go into a bookshop

00:04:28.883 --> 00:04:30.885
without making the front page.

00:04:30.885 --> 00:04:33.627
Leave him alone.

00:04:33.627 --> 00:04:35.237
Look, Potter.

00:04:35.237 --> 00:04:36.891
You've got yourself
a girlfriend.

00:04:36.891 --> 00:04:39.763
Now, now, Draco,
play nicely.

00:04:41.374 --> 00:04:42.636
Mr. Potter.

00:04:44.115 --> 00:04:46.683
Lucius Malfoy.

00:04:46.683 --> 00:04:49.208
We meet at last.

00:04:49.208 --> 00:04:51.688
Forgive me.

00:04:53.037 --> 00:04:54.909
Your scar is legend,

00:04:54.909 --> 00:04:57.694
as, of course, is the wizard
who gave it to you.

00:04:57.694 --> 00:05:00.088
Voldemort killed my parents.

00:05:01.742 --> 00:05:03.352
He was nothing more

00:05:03.352 --> 00:05:04.832
than a murderer.

00:05:04.832 --> 00:05:06.181
Hmm.

00:05:06.181 --> 00:05:09.750
You must be very brave
to mention his name,

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:11.665
or very foolish.

00:05:11.665 --> 00:05:13.144
Fear of a name

00:05:13.144 --> 00:05:15.538
only increases
fear of the thing itself.

00:05:17.410 --> 00:05:20.413
And you must be Miss Granger.

00:05:23.546 --> 00:05:27.550
Yes. Draco's told me
all about you and your parents.

00:05:31.467 --> 00:05:33.513
Muggles,

00:05:33.513 --> 00:05:35.732
aren't they?

00:05:37.343 --> 00:05:39.301
Let me see.

00:05:39.301 --> 00:05:42.261
Red hair, vacant expressions...

00:05:44.872 --> 00:05:48.528
tatty secondhand book...

00:05:48.528 --> 00:05:52.140
you must be the Weasleys.

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:55.056
Children, it's mad in here.
Let's go outside.

00:05:55.056 --> 00:05:56.840
Well, well, well...
Weasley senior.

00:05:56.840 --> 00:05:58.494
Lucius...

00:05:58.494 --> 00:06:02.846
Busy time at the Ministry,
Arthur, all those extra raids?

00:06:02.846 --> 00:06:05.327
I do hope
they're paying you overtime,

00:06:05.327 --> 00:06:07.460
but judging by
the state of this,

00:06:07.460 --> 00:06:09.113
I'd say not.

00:06:10.854 --> 00:06:12.508
What's the use
in being a disgrace

00:06:12.508 --> 00:06:14.684
to the name of wizard

00:06:14.684 --> 00:06:16.904
if they don't even
pay you well for it?

00:06:16.904 --> 00:06:18.819
We have a very different idea

00:06:18.819 --> 00:06:22.170
about what disgraces
the name of wizard, Malfoy.

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:23.302
Clearly.

00:06:26.392 --> 00:06:29.438
Associating with Muggles...

00:06:33.747 --> 00:06:37.098
And I thought
your family could sink no lower.

00:06:41.058 --> 00:06:44.279
I'll see you at work.

00:06:48.892 --> 00:06:49.980
See you at school.

00:06:59.207 --> 00:07:01.296
10:58. Come on, come on.

00:07:01.296 --> 00:07:02.819
Train will leaving
any moment.

00:07:02.819 --> 00:07:05.387
Fred, George,
Percy, you first.

00:07:10.827 --> 00:07:13.439
Okay.

00:07:18.531 --> 00:07:20.359
After you, dear.

00:07:22.317 --> 00:07:25.494
Come on, Ginny,
we'll get you a seat. Hurry.

00:07:26.713 --> 00:07:28.671
Let's go.

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:44.208
Oi. What do you two
think you're doing?

00:07:44.208 --> 00:07:46.210
Sorry.

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:48.430
Lost control
of the trolley.

00:07:49.736 --> 00:07:52.391
Why can't we get through?

00:07:52.391 --> 00:07:53.957
I don't know.

00:07:53.957 --> 00:07:56.220
The gateway has sealed
itself for some reason.

00:07:56.220 --> 00:07:57.483
[CLOCK CHIMES]

00:07:57.483 --> 00:08:00.137
The train leaves
at exactly 11:00.

00:08:00.137 --> 00:08:02.139
We've missed it.

00:08:02.139 --> 00:08:04.054
Harry...

00:08:04.054 --> 00:08:05.752
if we can't
get through,

00:08:05.752 --> 00:08:08.929
maybe Mum and Dad
can't get back.

00:08:08.929 --> 00:08:11.845
Maybe we should just go
and wait by the car.

00:08:13.847 --> 00:08:15.457
The car...

00:08:16.676 --> 00:08:18.721
[♪♪♪]

00:08:26.642 --> 00:08:29.210
Ron, I should tell you,

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:31.952
most Muggles aren't accustomed
to seeing a flying car.

00:08:31.952 --> 00:08:33.693
Uh...right.

00:08:52.668 --> 00:08:56.367
Oh, no. The invisibility booster
must be faulty.

00:08:56.367 --> 00:08:57.847
Well, come on, then,
let's go lower.

00:08:57.847 --> 00:08:59.153
We need to find the train.

00:08:59.153 --> 00:09:01.938
Okay.

00:09:11.818 --> 00:09:14.342
Now all we need to do
is catch up with the train.

00:09:14.342 --> 00:09:16.213
We can't be far behind.

00:09:16.213 --> 00:09:17.867
[TRAIN APPROACHING]

00:09:17.867 --> 00:09:18.999
Do you hear that?

00:09:18.999 --> 00:09:20.914
We must be getting close.

00:09:20.914 --> 00:09:23.786
Hold on...

